<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!--
    Platform logos, from the artwork under reference/icon (which is not in the repository). Each source
    is a single colour, so each is merged into one geometry here and the colour is applied by whatever
    draws it (PlatformIcon, which picks the geometry from the platform string a peer reported). The
    viewBoxes differ between icons and nothing downstream cares: every one is drawn fitted to its box.

    Regenerating one means concatenating the "d" attributes of its paths, in order, onto a single line.
  -->
